(i) use the Brand Assets, or any confusingly similar name, logo or artwork,
    for any purpose, or suggest that You or your server, product or service is
    affiliated with, endorsed by or the origin of the Software, other than a
    truthful statement that an Authorized Server uses RaskolClasses;

(j) use the Software or any Derivative Work to build, run or promote a product
    or service that substitutes for the Software;

(k) assign, transfer or sublicense this License or any right under it, or
