     Termination does not release You from liability for earlier breaches.
     Sections 1, 2.5, 2.6, 3 (for acts already done), 4, 5.5, 7 to 13 survive
     termination.

5.6. Reinstatement. Rights terminated under Section 5.3 are reinstated only if
     the Licensor says so in writing. The Licensor may refuse in its sole
